-- OurAirports, Public Domain — https://ourairports.com/data/ | OpenFlights, ODbL — https://openflights.org/data.php
-- Subset: All countries; all KH TH VN LA MM MY SG ID PH BN airports and worldwide large_airport rows. Keep OpenFlights active (Y) routes where both endpoint codes uniquely match included airport IATA or ICAO codes. Route ID is the 1-based source record number. Also keep the first five unused active airline IDs above 1.
-- Mapping: Airport and country attributes come from OurAirports. Route airline ID and endpoint codes come from OpenFlights; airport IDs are the matched OurAirports IDs.
